unmotion: unMotion (VM mobility and replication for Unraid)
unmotion:
unmotion: unMotion provides cloning, cold and prepared Warm Move migration,
unmotion: and scheduled replication for Unraid KVM/libvirt VMs. Migration
unmotion: supports ZFS and sparse file copies. Replication intentionally
unmotion: requires dedicated ZFS zvols or datasets and keeps standby storage
unmotion: inert until separately guarded coordinated manual recovery.
